Package: snapforge
Type: Package
Title: Official R Client for the SnapForge Screenshot API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("AgentForge", "Labs", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.com")
Description: Provides an idiomatic client for the hosted SnapForge screenshot
    and page-context API, with explicit self-hosted support, bearer or URL-secret
    authentication, quota metadata, structured credential-safe errors,
    idempotency keys, persisted job helpers, and a forward-compatible public
    API request escape hatch.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/AgentForge-Labs/snapforge-r,
    https://snapforge.web-tasarimci.com
BugReports: https://github.com/AgentForge-Labs/snapforge-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite (>= 1.8.8)
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
